/**
 * @module concepts-registry
 * @fileoverview Registry of the concepts used across the project, written so each entry can be read
 * on its own (no assumed prior knowledge) and cross-linked to related concepts.
 *
 * Sources merged here:
 *  - src/data/glossary.js (781 entries). Most entries are engine headwords ("imp-NNNN ...") or one-off
 *    measurement notes; those are NOT concepts and are excluded. Their pages stay reachable through the
 *    `sources` of the concept they belong to. glossary.js is ~2.2 MB, so it is NOT imported; the
 *    concept text below is copied/condensed.
 *  - the CONCEPTS array in src/pages/ConceptsPage.jsx (foundations, zeta, primes, physics, random
 *    matrices, quantum, thermodynamics, information theory, twistors, proof strategies).
 *  - status and sources from src/data/rh-landscape-dag.js and src/data/project-attempts-dag.js.
 *  - concepts from the September/October 2026 work: source floor, Kronecker floor, structured floor,
 *    prefix/cell, weak outer lemma (WOL-C), decreasing zero-height barrier (Raymond), two-band argument
 *    (Lemma B), local RH window (r2-*, r3-*, r6-synthesis, b145-*, s145-*, dag3-*, tlb-* modules).
 *
 * Status language: Platt–Trudgian Λ ≤ 0.2 is the accepted peer-reviewed benchmark. Project values below
 * 0.2 (e.g. the Λ ≤ 0.1758354 candidate) are computer-assisted and not refereed, or
 * conditional. RH is open. Nothing here claims a proof of RH.
 *
 * Exports: CONCEPTS_REGISTRY, CONCEPT_CLASSES, ALIAS_INDEX, findConcept, CONCEPTS_REGISTRY_ASSERTIONS.
 * Import-free (no zeros bundle, no glossary import).
 */

